            "startLine1based": 949,
            "endLine1based": 982,
            "text": "def(\"삼각비\", \"01\", \"삼각비의 값\", SEC.뜻, \"기본\", (rng) => {\n    const [p, q, r] = pick(rng, TRIPLES);\n    const mode = intBetween(rng, 0, 2);\n    // $\\angle B=90^\\circ$ — $\\overline{BC}$ 가 $\\angle A$ 의 대변, $\\overline{AB}$ 가 이웃변.\n    // mode 2($\\tan A=\\overline{BC}/\\overline{AB}$)는 진분수여야 하므로 대변을 짧게 고정한다.\n    const swap = mode === 2 ? false : rng() < 0.5;\n    const bc = swap ? q : p;\n    const ab = swap ? p : q;\n    const [num, den] = red(mode === 1 ? ab : bc, mode === 2 ? ab : r);\n    const asked = trigOf(mode, \"A\");\n    const ratio = [\n      `\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{BC}}{\\\\overline{AC}}`,\n      `\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{AB}}{\\\\overline{AC}}`,\n      `\\\\dfrac{\\\\overline{BC}}{\\\\overline{AB}}`,\n    ][mode]!;\n    const raw = [\n      `\\\\dfrac{${bc}}{${r}}`,\n      `\\\\dfrac{${ab}}{${r}}`,\n      `\\\\dfrac{${bc}}{${ab}}`,\n    ][mode]!;\n    return {\n      content: `직각삼각형 $ABC$에서 $\\\\angle B=90^\\\\circ$이고 $\\\\overline{AB}=${cm(ab)}$, $\\\\overline{BC}=${cm(bc)}$일 때, $${asked}$의 값을 구하시오.`,\n      answer: `$${frac(num, den)}$`,\n      solution: `피타고라스 정리에서 $\\\\overline{AC}=\\\\sqrt{${ab}^2+${bc}^2}=${r}\\\\,(\\\\mathrm{cm})$이다.\\n따라서 $${asked}=${ratio}=${raw === frac(num, den) ? raw : `${raw}=${frac(num, den)}`}$이다.`,\n      facts: { ab, bc, ac: r, mode, num, den },\n      figureSpec: figRight({\n        vert: ab,\n        horz: bc,\n        dims: { AB: dimCm(ab), BC: dimCm(bc) },\n      }),\n    };\n  }),\n\n  "
          }
        }
